2023 amendment to Regulation 7 [SEBI/SEBI_CIR_2023_149 / para 1] states that if the requirements specified under Explanation to clause (a) are not fulfilled, the sponsor shall:

(i) adequately capitalize the asset management company such that the net worth of the asset management company is not less than rupees one hundred fifty crore [SEBI/SEBI_CIR_2023_149 / para 7(i)];

(ii) ensure that the initial shareholding equivalent to capital contributed to the asset management company to the extent of not less than rupees one hundred fifty crore is locked-in for a period of five years [SEBI/SEBI_CIR_2023_149 / para 7(ii)];

(iii) appoint experienced personnel in asset management company such that the total combined experience of Chief Executive Officer, Chief Operating Officer, Chief Risk Officer, Chief Compliance Officer and Chief Investment Officer should be at least thirty years [SEBI/SEBI_CIR_2023_149 / para 7(iii)].

